        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Estates Solid Brass Traditional Rosettes</B><p>\r\nTraditional styled rosettes that pair with any of the Baldwin Estates line of brass levers or knobs.  Available in three sizes and many finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> Traditional Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material:  Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with black finish mounting wood screws.</li>\r\n<li>For exterior and interior use.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime No-Rust Warranty!</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>5002</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter:  1.75\"</li>\r\n<li><b>Will not cover standard 2-1/8\" bore</b></li>\r\n<li>Only available as dummy or passage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>5017</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter:  2.25\"\"</li>\r\n<li>Only available as dummy or passage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>5048, 5148</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter:  2.625\"</li>\r\n<li>Available as dummy, passage or privacy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
